  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1" flags="0x0">
    <title>B1 - Bypass demand filter gain - state override</title>
    <description>Fixed filter gain replacing both demand-filter curves in the indicated state. Evidence: CPU E35B6..E35C6 selects cal10FD; E35FA..E3602 passes gain&lt;&lt;8 to BCf54. Confidence: confirmed_code Source image: C230Kompressor_SIM4LE_5WK90416_M10062_6577815126_full.bin. Calibration block 1. FD22.12=1, FD88.0=1, FD6A.5=1. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent.</description>
