    <description>Per-update first-order gain filtering calculated demand E3CA toward E3C8. Larger gain responds faster; it is not a position percentage. Evidence: CPU E35A4..E3602: select curve33EA/33F2, gain&lt;&lt;8, BCf54 filter, store E3C8. Confidence: confirmed_code Source image: C230Kompressor_SIM4LE_5WK90416_M10062_6577815126_full.bin. Calibration block 3. FD22.12=0 or FD88.0=0. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent. Sampling period not established; % is fraction of remaining error per update, not seconds.</description>
