  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x107" flags="0x0">
    <title>B3 - Bypass control flow-model correction</title>
    <description>Intermediate map in the air-flow model feeding bypass demand. Output E3D6 is optionally filtered to E3E0, then multiplied by C9E6 and E2C8. Evidence: CPU E348E..E3500: ratio E3D8; axes26AC/26BE and tableB7A6 via BC002/BC0E6/BC256; writes E3D6/E3E0/E3D4. Confidence: confirmed_code Source image: C230Kompressor_SIM4LE_5WK90416_M10062_6577815126_full.bin. Calibration block 3. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent. C9E4=floor(RPM*cal9702/1024), calibrated speed ratio 2683/1024 in this block. E3D8=E3DE/E2C8 in Q14. Underlying pressure/flow physical interpretation remains unverified; this is not a direct target-boost map.</description>
