  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1fc" flags="0x0">
    <title>B5 - Bypass flap target position characteristic</title>
    <description>Converts calculated flow demand to second-air-flap target position, before adding ignition-retard intervention E3DC and transition rate limiting. Evidence: CPU E35F2..E361A: filter demand E3C8; axis291A/curveA840 via BC002/BC1F2; add E3DC. E32E2..E337C stores/clamps E3C4. E2780..E2928 closes position loop and drives PW3. Confidence: confirmed_code; physical bypass attribution strong inference Source image: C230Kompressor_SIM4LE_5WK90416_M10062_6577815126_full.bin. Calibration block 5. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent.</description>
